    'HappiWell Medical Clinic is a medical clinic registered as a primary care unit in the Gold Card scheme, located in Thung Khru, Bangkok. Our doctors treat common illnesses. Besides the Gold Card, we also accept Social Security and self-paying patients.',
    'How to use your Gold Card at HappiWell Clinic',
    'If HappiWell Clinic is your registered service unit, you can be treated free of charge. If you are not sure which unit you are registered with, check your rights in the Pao Tang app or ask us at the clinic.',
    'What can be treated with the Gold Card?',
    'A medical clinic like HappiWell treats a wide range of everyday illnesses, such as:',
